{"publicId":"02811b12-b325-482d-90cf-4f0c0bf4d0c9","title":"中国四家Android厂商推行开发者身份验证机制","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T11:18:31.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-10T11:18:31.000Z","digest":"中国主要Android厂商OPPO、vivo、小米、荣耀推出侧载应用开发者身份验证（ADV），要求开发者通过审核以建立应用可信关联，目前该机制已覆盖四家厂商的侧载应用生态。\n\nADV要求开发者提交身份证明及安全承诺，审核通过后获得唯一标识，用户可识别应用来源。此举旨在减少恶意软件和隐私泄露风险，但尚未公布审核标准及通过率。\n\n目前仅OPPO、vivo、小米、荣耀四家厂商明确实施ADV，其他Android厂商暂未跟进。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-10T13:27:21.432Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"中国 Android 厂商启动开发者身份验证","latestReport":{"id":"rcgcffwbvitvzbxvcp3aqoil0"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fG11jKk-s8lI","title":"中国 Android 厂商开始要求开发者身份验证","firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T11:18:31.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"rcgcffwbvitvzbxvcp3aqoil0","title":"中国 Android 厂商启动开发者身份验证","summary":"中国主要 Android 厂商 OPPO、vivo、小米、荣耀推出 Android 侧载应用开发者身份验证（ADV），支持验证结果互认，旨在建立开发者与其应用之间的可信关联，保障用户应用安全。","source":{"name":"奇客 Solidot","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T11:18:31.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"rcgcffwbvitvzbxvcp3aqoil0","title":"中国 Android 厂商启动开发者身份验证","summary":"中国主要 Android 厂商 OPPO、vivo、小米、荣耀推出 Android 侧载应用开发者身份验证（ADV），支持验证结果互认，旨在建立开发者与其应用之间的可信关联，保障用户应用安全。","source":{"name":"奇客 Solidot","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T11:18:31.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T16:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T21:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T22:00:00.000Z","heat":7.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"